{"version":1,"content":"<p>三星即將推出新一代中國市場專屬高端摺疊屏手機W27。近日，一張疑似真機照片在網絡曝光。知名爆料人士透露，三星計劃於10月29日正式發佈這款新品，其核心配置將與Galaxy Z Fold8 Ultra保持一致。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583482.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:51.778018+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:31:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_hash":"7fc2114b245fc3196988dce0554e8c5bcb3b80a14f7ad9b47cafc9020225cab3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}